          R: a string specifying the dependent variable in `data`
      - name: ind
        title: Independent Variables
        type: Variables
        default: null
        description:
          R: a vector of strings specifying the independent variables in `data`
      - name: modelTerms
        title: Model Terms
        type: Terms
        default: null
        description:
          R: a list of string vectors specifying the model terms
